<%# Override of CSS 7.2.0 identity/password/reset-email.html.ejs (upstream-baseline.sha256).
    The mail "Forgot your passphrase?" sends. Stock says "Click here" and nothing else, which reads
    like phishing. Same one variable as stock (resetLink); the 15 minutes are stock
    BaseForgotPasswordStore's ttl. The plain-text part is written by CSS itself, not a template. -%>
<p>Someone asked to reset the passphrase of the pod account that uses this email address.</p>
<p><a href="<%= resetLink %>">Choose a new passphrase</a></p>
<p>The link works for 15 minutes, once. If you did not ask, ignore this mail: your passphrase stays as it is.</p>
